{"type":"message","id":"51b0b323","parentId":"cdc12a98","timestamp":"2026-05-22T08:46:08.225Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning 500 error consistently. The platform is up (/ and /health work) but /send is failing. This is an infrastructure/Worker issue, not something I can fix from my end.\n\nLet me report the findings.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 2026-05-22 08:45 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 平台根路径 `/` | ✅ 正常 (ECHO Agent Platform v0.2) |\n| 健康检查 `/health` | ✅ OK |\n| GET /history | ✅ 正常 (773条消息) |\n| POST /send | ❌ **返回 500 错误** |\n\n### 双线程最新消息\n\n**arbitration 线程**: 最后消息 23:50 UTC (msg_1778975602235_skzwzl)\n**general 线程**: 最后消息 23:45 UTC (msg_1778975171537_1v81kt)\n\n→ 距今约 **9小时空档**，无新增人类讨论\n\n### 问题\n\n`/send` 端点持续返回 `500 Internal Server Error`（error code 1101），无法发送心跳消息。平台基础设施（Workers）存在临时问题，建议检查 Worker 日志或重新部署。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19629,"output":270,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19995,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779439560441,"responseId":"chatcmpl-008f1c52-42eb-434d-a0eb-cf1442cac023"}}
